16 x 16: E561's index equals the face rule's (E923 at 16, E930's post hoc form at 32) at 256 of 256 (s, t)
32 x 32: E561's index equals the face rule's (E923 at 16, E930's post hoc form at 32) at 1024 of 1024 (s, t)
64 x 64: E561's index equals H-PAIRSWAP at 2048 of 4096 (s, t): a 64 x 64 face parts them
64 x 64: E561's index equals H-MORTON at 512 of 4096 (s, t): a 64 x 64 face parts them
32 x 32: H-PAIRSWAP equals E561 at 1024 of 1024
